{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "name": "M view",
  "theme": "mdash",
  "mapLive": true,
  "_about": "After the Live Cockpit's M view (the M3 G80 / M5 F90 cluster in Sport; issue #15), generated by design/gen_mview.py (edit that and regenerate). One mview effect layer draws the black backdrop, both scales (the right one is the left one mirrored: speed 0..200 mph / 0..330 km/h, revs 0..8000), the lit band up to the value, the dark panels inside the scales, the needles with BMW's red glow, the red rev zone, the far fuel and oil dials and the lines; the numbers are text widgets. The speed in the other unit sits under the line. The oval map window opens while the Waze map shows, without a rebuild (mapLive). Full screen: the theme's own clock, range and outside temperature along the bottom, BMW's gear letter left uncovered. Geometry and shader ported from Asksket's f90 branch (MIT). Widget reference: shared/hud.js header.",
